# Build context hygiene. The datasets are the largest thing in the repo and no container
# needs them: they are evaluation inputs, read by tests on the host.
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
# Recursive, deliberately. A bare *.tsbuildinfo matches only the repository root, so the
# per-package files were copied into the image; tsc -b then read them, concluded the
# build was current, and emitted nothing. The result was an image with no dist/ and no
# error to explain it.
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.github
.env
.env.*
storage
datasets
evaluation
sample-output
docs
*.md
.claude
.code-review-graph
